Sprint: Post-Homepage Product Discovery Components (Pass 2 - Data)
Focus: Data Connectivity (Pass 2) using catalogue-index.json and Sanity.
Dependency: Pass 1 Skeletons Complete; Atomic Leaf Truth Verified.
Difficulty: 8 - A, Forward progress: Data integration for discovery flow — → closes 0 DoD items, Pass 2 Baseline

Velocity Scope Contract: Discovery Data Pass
Target: Data Flow Only.

1. The Fenced Territory (IN SCOPE)
Objective: Map the verified Truth Table IDs to the actual UI slots created in Pass 1.

DoD Item: Navigating to a Category ID displays the exact product list defined in catalogue-index.json.

DoD Item: Clicking a product in the grid loads the correct document data on the Detail page.

2. The Forbidden Territory (OUT OF SCOPE)
No CSS/Tailwind: Do not "fix" the layout if the data makes it look weird.

No Loading States: Use standard text "Loading..." or empty slots; no complex skeletons/spinners yet.

No Error UI: If data fails, console log it; do not build "Not Found" pages in this pass.

