Sprint: Post-Homepage Product Discovery Components (Pass 3 — High-Fidelity)
Focus: Visual & Interactive Lockdown per Component.
Execution: End-to-End completion of one component (Steps 1-4) before starting the next.
Difficulty: 13 - E, Polish: High-fidelity component locking — → closes 0 DoD items, Pass 3 Complete

Component Build Protocol
No Leapfrogging: Component [N] must be 100% styled and tested before Component [N+1] structure starts.

Lockdown: Once a component passes its specific test and manual UI review, it is LOCKED.


Component 1: SearchOverlay.tsx
[ ] Step 1: Structure — Define HTML5 semantic tags, focus trap wrapper, and input/results container.

[ ] Step 2: Layout — Apply Flex/Grid for positioning (centered modal or full-screen slide).

[ ] Step 3: Styling — Apply colors, typography, backdrop-blur, and borders.

[ ] Step 4: Interactivity — Implement Framer Motion transitions and hover/focus ring states.

[ ] Test: it('renders valid structure and toggles visibility')

Component 2: FilterSidebar.tsx
[ ] Step 1: Structure — Define <aside> with nested <section> tags for filter groups.

[ ] Step 2: Layout — Sticky positioning, vertical spacing, and alignment of checkboxes.

[ ] Step 3: Styling — Custom checkbox styles, accent colors, and scrollbar aesthetics.

[ ] Step 4: Interactivity — Accordion expand/collapse logic and hover feedback on labels.

[ ] Test: it('correctly toggles filter group sections')

Component 3: CategoryGrid.tsx
[ ] Step 1: Structure — Define <section> wrapper and <ul> list for product cards.

[ ] Step 2: Layout — Lock responsive grid (e.g., grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4).

[ ] Step 3: Styling — Container padding, gap sizing, and background tokens.

[ ] Step 4: Interactivity — Implement staggered entrance animations for the grid items.

[ ] Test: it('matches specified grid column count at 1440px')

Component 4: ProductDetails.tsx
[ ] Step 1: Structure — Define <main> with two primary columns: Gallery and Meta.

[ ] Step 2: Layout — Aspect-ratio locking for images and vertical flow for text hierarchy.

[ ] Step 3: Styling — High-contrast CTA buttons, price typography, and spec tables.

[ ] Step 4: Interactivity — Image thumbnail syncing and "Add to Cart" button bounce states.

[ ] Test: it('syncs main image when thumbnail is clicked')